 "text": "Hey there, how are you? Not at all. Many people prefer to be out in nature by themselves, it' peaceful. Good rule. Bring a lunch, a blanket, a blanket and something to read in case you stay longer than planned. Usually people give what feels right. A few pounds is usually enough. Nice. Leave the area exactly as you found it, and take any rubbish with you. That's the best kind of picnic. Enjoy your time, and don't rush back.",
